
#DEBUG
0                 debug level (0 = no info, 10 = max info)
0                 cpu to watch
60.0              dt between normal code output to stdout
F                 usebarriers - forces the code to stop and wait more often

#RESTART
F                 Restart Code

#TIMESTART
2024              year
05                month
09                day
00                hour
00                minute
00                second

#TIMEEND
2024              year
05                month
15                day
00                hour
00                minute
00                second

#GRID
10                nBlocksLongitude
10                nBlocksLatitude
-90.000000        min latitude to model (deg)
90.000000         max latitude to model (deg)
0.000000          min longitude to model (deg)
0.000000          max longitude to model (0 = whole earth) (deg)


#SAVEPLOTS
3600              dt for restarts
1                 number of plot types
3DALL             plot type
300               dt for plot type 3DALL

#AURORAMODS
T   NormalizeAuroraToHP     (logical)
1.0   AveEFactor    (real)
F   IsKappaAurora     (logical)
3   AuroraKappa    (real)
F   AllowAurWODiffuse (logical)
80.0   MaxAveEAurora    (real)

#NGDC_INDICES
UA/DataIn/f107.txt   no descriptor

#EUV_DATA
T                 Use FISM Solar Flux Data (daily)
UA/DataIn/FISM/fismflux_daily_2024.dat   FISM Filename

#ELECTRODYNAMICS
FTA
60.0
weimer05
60.0

#SME_INDICES
ae_20240505_100yr.txt
none              onset time delay file
T                 Convert AE to HP


#MHD_INDICES
imf_20240505_100yr.txt

#DYNAMO
T                 UseDynamo
45.0              Dynamo magnetic latitude boundary
500               nIterations
1.0               Max Residual
F                 Include Cowling Conductances
40.0              Longitude Averaging

#APEX
T                 no descriptor


#MSIS21
T


#AUSMSOLVER
T                 Use AUSM+-up Solvers

